Require more params input, eg. ./start-cli.sh(start-cli.bat if Windows) -h xxx.xxx.xxx.xxx -p xxxx -u xxx.
For more information, please check the following hint.
usage: IoTDB [-c] [-disableISO8601] [-e <execute>] [-h <host>] [-help] [-p <port>] [-pw
       <password>] [-timeout <queryTimeout>] [-tpw <trust_store_pwd>] [-ts
       <trust_store>] -u <username> [-usessl <use_ssl>]
 -c                        Rpc Compression enabled or not
 -disableISO8601           Display timestamp in number(optional)
 -e <execute>              execute statement (optional)
 -h <host>                 Host Name (optional, default 127.0.0.1)
 -help                     Display help information(optional)
 -p <port>                 Port (optional, default 6667)
 -pw <password>            password (optional)
 -timeout <queryTimeout>   The timeout in second. Using the configuration of server if
                           it's not set (optional)
 -tpw <trust_store_pwd>    trust_store_pwd statement (optional)
 -ts <trust_store>         trust_store statement (optional)
 -u <username>             User name (required)
 -usessl <use_ssl>         use_ssl statement (optional)
